   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kvinnors v&#xe4;rldar, m&#xe4;ns v&#xe4;rldar: Dialog och kommunikation ang sexualitet och sexuellt smittsamma sjukdomar/HIV bland ungdomar i Afrika. Workshop i Uganda m. deltagande fr ber&#xf6;rda institutioner f&#xf6;r diskussion planerna &amp; utarbeta en reviderad ans&#xf6;kan. Fokus studier om ungdomars sexualvanor &amp; utnyttjande av h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rd f.STDs, om STD v&#xe5;rd inom den privata sektorn&amp;kvaliteten p&#xe5; STDv&#xe5;rden partneranm&#xe4;lan</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women&apos;s worlds, men&apos;s worlds: Dialogue and communication on sexuality and STD/HIV among young people in Africa. Workshop in Uganda w. particip. fr institutions f discussion plans &amp; make revised  application. Concentrate on studies on youths sexual habits &amp; use of healthcare for STDs, on STD care in private sector &amp; quality of STD care focu on partnerinfo.</narrative>
